      "message": "I think what I\u0027m reading is:\n1. Create a singleton for this entitled \"BuildSystemStats\" or whatever jargon that gets hooked in somewhere during the analysis phase, defaulting to Soong for each. It could be as simple as a map for now. I\u0027ll need a pointer for where a good place to hook _all_ modules in resides (namely, #1 in your other comment - those that don\u0027t even call this. Is this the proper field to utilize? https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/ui/metrics/metrics_proto/metrics.pb.go;l\u003d591;drc\u003d450b938185d40e82b0d28d8f2da134b035e72088;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1 )\n2. MixedBuildsEnabled updates the value for passed keys wherever valid. I don\u0027t think this is an absurd side-effect, but we could also update it after a call if that\u0027s too \"intrusive\". (This would also allow us to do more than just \"ask\" for the log in the comment.)\n3. Write this out during the WriteMetricsMethod.",
