      "writtenOn": "2022-04-21T20:06:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since we\u0027re only calling this from module types which *may* be migrated to Bazel, it means that module types which we have not started migrating (such as rust_library) don\u0027t get logged at all.\n\nIt\u0027s worth documenting that there are really three types of support to log:\n\n1. Doesn\u0027t show up in mixed build metrics at all -- it has no hope of being migrated\n2. Shows up in mixed build metrics as \"Soong\" -- there\u0027s some reason it\u0027s not actually handled by mixed builds, but could conceivably be if we flip a few things\n3. Shows up in metrics as \"Bazel\" -- it was used in Mixed builds.\n\n\nComments on the proto (that I describe in the below comment) would be a good place to note this.",
      "revId": "c4649691ca8c4c908bcd06d636f77a9d1b0dcae6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
